Everything under `data/` is derived from the MaleCNS v1.0 connectome released
by the Janelia FlyEM project (HHMI Janelia Research Campus) with Google
Research and collaborators, and is licensed CC-BY 4.0.

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

If you use it, attribute:

    Dorkenwald, S., Matsliah, A., Sterling, A.R. et al.
    Sexual dimorphism in the complete connectome of the Drosophila male
    central nervous system. Cell (2026).
    https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cell.2026.08.015

    Dataset: male-cns:v1.0, Janelia FlyEM.
    https://male-cns.janelia.org/
